---
kind: lore
id: hearth.board
title: The board by the Hearth door
---

<entry id="boardChores" on="hearthBoard" category="note" title="Chores (Maud)">
  @maud{code="0010"}: Wood. Water. Sweep the ash off the bottom step or it follows you up. — M.
</entry>

<entry id="boardTally" on="hearthBoard" category="note" title="A tally, unsigned" priority="5" when="user.deaths >= 1">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Someone has pinned up a strip of bark with {{user.deaths:plural(one notch|# notches)}} in it. The newest notch is still pale.
</entry>

<entry id="boardForge" on="hearthBoard" category="note" title="Wanted: one hammerhead (Oskar)" priority="10" when="quest.coldForge.state == 'active'">
  @oskar{code="0010"}: WANTED — one maul-head, smith's mark on the cheek. Reward: a warm forge and my undying irritation. — O.
</entry>

<entry id="boardFeather" on="hearthBoard" category="note" title="In a thin, careful hand" priority="15" when="user.knowsSableName">
  @sable{code="0010"}: If the grey feather comes back without you, I'll keep it for you. If it doesn't come back, don't tell me. — S.
</entry>

<entry id="boardAshfall" on="hearthBoard" category="note" title="Pinned with a grey petal" priority="20" when="user.ashfallOn">
  @maud{code="0020"}: LILIES WANTED. Three. Tea to follow. {{season.ashfall.lilies:plural(One in the pot so far|# in the pot so far)}}. — M.
</entry>
